## 5. Why This Topic Matters

Machine learning systems can affect real people.

Examples:

```text
loan approval
job applicant screening
student risk prediction
medical screening
fraud detection
policing risk tools
insurance pricing
content moderation
recommendation systems
facial recognition
```

If the model is wrong or unfair, people may be harmed.

### Possible Harms

```text
unfair rejection
loss of opportunity
incorrect medical support
privacy breach
discrimination
stress or stigma
financial loss
loss of trust
lack of explanation
over-reliance on automated decisions
```

### Key Idea

A technically accurate model may still be ethically risky.

