Recommend three methods to reduce privacy risk when using data for machine learning.

<details>
<summary>Mark Scheme Style Answer</summary>

Data minimization should be used so only necessary data is collected. Consent or a clear purpose should be established so users understand how their data is used. Access control and encryption should protect data from unauthorized access. Anonymization or pseudonymization can reduce identification risk. Retention limits should also be used so personal data is deleted or anonymized when no longer needed.

</details>

